FRR — Fluid Relational Reasoning

FRR v0.4 originates as a public reasoning seed ("Fluid Relational Reasoning,
v0.4 — Residual Location and Field Change"). This repository is a structured,
navigable rendering of that discipline as a host-neutral, Markdown-based reasoning
system, with an added records layer (schemas, validators, tests) that makes the
load-bearing claims checkable.

The field content faithfully carries the source discipline. The records layer, the
load path (FRR.md / BOOT.md / kernel / field / passes), and the validators are this
repository's contribution. No rule depends on a specific vendor, model, product, or
client.

This system is advisory reasoning discipline. It is not a guarantee of correctness,
and it does not promise final ground.
